###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasPreparationForReuseInstruction
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasPreparationForReuseInstruction> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                           rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstancePresence> ;
                                                           rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstanceManagementInstruction> ;
