Substance is modelled in the EU DPP CO SOC module.
SubstanceIdentifier is modelled in the EU DPP CO IDENT module."""@en ;
                                                rdfs:label "has substance identifier"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasSubstancePresence
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasSubstancePresence> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                              owl:inverseOf <https://w3id.org/eudpp#isSubstancePresenceOf> ;
                                              rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Product> ;
                                              rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstancePresence> ;
                                              rdfs:comment """Relation from Product to contextual SubstancePresence.

Product is modelled in the EU DPP CO P_DPP module.
SubstancePresence is modelled in the EU DPP CO IDENT module."""@en ;
                                              rdfs:label "has substance presence"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasTypeOfReview
