Actor is modelled in the EU DPP CO ACTOR module.
        """@en ;
                                                rdfs:label "identifies data provider"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#identifiesManufacturer
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#identifiesManufacturer> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ManufacturerRecord> ;
                                                rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> ;
