SubstancePresence is modelled in the EU DPP CO IDENT module."""@en ;
                                            rdfs:label "is located in product"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#isNotifiedFor
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#isNotifiedFor> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                       rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Actor> ;
                                       rdfs:range <https://w3id.org/eudpp#UnionHarmonisationLegislation> ;
