###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#substanceLocationDescription
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#substanceLocationDescription> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                      rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstancePresence> ;
                                                      rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                                                      <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Article 7(5)(b)"@en ;
                                                      <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj> ;
                                                      rdfs:comment "A textual description of the location of the substance within the product, used where the location cannot be represented solely by linking to a product, component or spare part."@en ;
                                                      rdfs:isDefinedBy :SOC ;
                                                      rdfs:label "Location description"@en ;
                                                      <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> "ESPR-grounded ontology modelling abstraction; this RDF resource is not itself a term defined by the Regulation."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#tolerance
