                              rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                              rdfs:comment "The Universally Unique Identifier of this LCA / EPD study, as mandated by ILCD+EPD as the primary persistent identifier. Once a study is created and a UUID is generated, the UUID stays the same forever; any change increments eudpp:dataSetVersion. String formatted as an RFC 4122 UUID (36 characters, hyphenated)."@en ;
                              rdfs:label "UUID"@en ;
                              <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ILCD base"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#validFrom
